# ============ 构建产物(Eclipse 生成,可重新编译) ============
# 注意: Release/ 下的 makefile 配置是编译必需的,必须保留!
#       (编译容器在 Release/ 目录执行 make,克隆后可直接编译)
Release/*.o
Release/*.d
Release/smallmgc
Release/**/*.o
Release/**/*.d
Debug/
Debug_without_ISDN/

# 对象文件 / 依赖文件
*.o
*.d

# ============ 数据库(SQLite,程序自动生成) ============
*.db
*.db-journal

# ============ 日志 ============
*.log

# ============ 部署产物(build.sh 拷贝,可重新生成) ============
docker-deploy/smallmgc
docker-deploy/runtime/test.db
docker-deploy/runtime/calls.db
docker-deploy/runtime/smallmgc.log

# ============ 系统 / IDE ============
.DS_Store
*.swp

# ============ 版本控制残留(SVN 元数据) ============
.svn/

# 配置备份(调试产物)
configuration.xml.bak
configuration.xml.bridge
configuration.xml.running
